    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3660360/extras/9175cf3db507f6bf8189d297ce38aca5.avif?t=1746196254\" width=620 height=142 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3660360/extras/dce564abdd2ecb96b3e956b818fd5efa.avif?t=1746196254\" width=677 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3660360/extras/20de1e45f04bbdd8c4f03731d20799f2.avif?t=1746196254\" width=620 height=142 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3660360/extras/3106cd188d42d8338f20beb34e9ad2bd.webp?t=1746196254\" width=357 height=61 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3660360/extras/aa4b4cf8a1556f7862969d6a35699849.poster.avif?t=1746196254\" width=620 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3660360/extras/aa4b4cf8a1556f7862969d6a35699849.webm?t=1746196254\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3660360/extras/aa4b4cf8a1556f7862969d6a35699849.mp4?t=1746196254\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything used to be peaceful until an ancient artifact appeared in your shop. From that moment on, unexplainable things started happening. Strange fog, rustles and stares... It's like someone's staring at you from behind your back. Just try to survive and stay afloat, and don't turn back when you feel a breath from behind you, THEN RUN!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3660360/extras/6068270f38a12cdb77bada17b79617f2.avif?t=1746196254\" width=481 height=80 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3660360/extras/34959655fca10436476a4efe21ff42cb.poster.avif?t=1746196254\" width=620 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3660360/extras/34959655fca10436476a4efe21ff42cb.webm?t=1746196254\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3660360/extras/34959655fca10436476a4efe21ff42cb.mp4?t=1746196254\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You should be careful when buying new and unusual \u201cstuff\u201d from now on. Who knows what you'll buy this time, an ordinary antique ring that you'll repair and resell x2 the price, or a cursed monk's skull that carries only death?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3660360/extras/3b58cb84e9c50b790570e2267fa0f9a6.avif?t=1746196254\" width=688 height=79 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3660360/extras/479c621bdf17ab5b0e1dff539b863667.poster.avif?t=1746196254\" width=620 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3660360/extras/479c621bdf17ab5b0e1dff539b863667.webm?t=1746196254\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3660360/extras/479c621bdf17ab5b0e1dff539b863667.mp4?t=1746196254\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We've got it figured out, the main focus is to survive and avoid bankruptcy. But you still haven't solved that crazy mystery. Gods? Demons? Or the evil spirits of cursed things? Who have you enraged? Go and find out! Or die like the previous owner... It's up to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3660360/extras/b00629d80704ebeb889dc9d0b113f29f.avif?t=1746196254\" width=620 height=142 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3660360/extras/9175cf3db507f6bf8189d297ce38aca5.avif?t=1746196254\" width=620 height=142 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3660360/extras/dce564abdd2ecb96b3e956b818fd5efa.avif?t=1746196254\" width=677 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3660360/extras/20de1e45f04bbdd8c4f03731d20799f2.avif?t=1746196254\" width=620 height=142 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3660360/extras/3106cd188d42d8338f20beb34e9ad2bd.webp?t=1746196254\" width=357 height=61 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3660360/extras/aa4b4cf8a1556f7862969d6a35699849.poster.avif?t=1746196254\" width=620 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3660360/extras/aa4b4cf8a1556f7862969d6a35699849.webm?t=1746196254\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3660360/extras/aa4b4cf8a1556f7862969d6a35699849.mp4?t=1746196254\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything used to be peaceful until an ancient artifact appeared in your shop. From that moment on, unexplainable things started happening. Strange fog, rustles and stares... It's like someone's staring at you from behind your back. Just try to survive and stay afloat, and don't turn back when you feel a breath from behind you, THEN RUN!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3660360/extras/6068270f38a12cdb77bada17b79617f2.avif?t=1746196254\" width=481 height=80 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3660360/extras/34959655fca10436476a4efe21ff42cb.poster.avif?t=1746196254\" width=620 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3660360/extras/34959655fca10436476a4efe21ff42cb.webm?t=1746196254\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3660360/extras/34959655fca10436476a4efe21ff42cb.mp4?t=1746196254\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You should be careful when buying new and unusual \u201cstuff\u201d from now on. Who knows what you'll buy this time, an ordinary antique ring that you'll repair and resell x2 the price, or a cursed monk's skull that carries only death?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3660360/extras/3b58cb84e9c50b790570e2267fa0f9a6.avif?t=1746196254\" width=688 height=79 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3660360/extras/479c621bdf17ab5b0e1dff539b863667.poster.avif?t=1746196254\" width=620 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3660360/extras/479c621bdf17ab5b0e1dff539b863667.webm?t=1746196254\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3660360/extras/479c621bdf17ab5b0e1dff539b863667.mp4?t=1746196254\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We've got it figured out, the main focus is to survive and avoid bankruptcy. But you still haven't solved that crazy mystery. Gods? Demons? Or the evil spirits of cursed things? Who have you enraged? Go and find out! Or die like the previous owner... It's up to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3660360/extras/b00629d80704ebeb889dc9d0b113f29f.avif?t=1746196254\" width=620 height=142 /></span></p>",
